          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Para a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o da <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(k||)</marimo-tex>-indu\u00e7\u00e3o e das fun\u00e7\u00f5es de simula\u00e7\u00e3o e de testes foi usado o recurso \u00e0 LLM Claude.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Link para a conversa: <a href=\"https://claude.ai/share/788d45be-9ca5-4cc2-b450-8e8ddd361886\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://claude.ai/share/788d45be-9ca5-4cc2-b450-8e8ddd361886</a></span></span>"
          }
