            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Para a realiza\u00e7\u00e3o do c\u00f3digo do ponto 2 foi usado o recurso \u00e0 LLM Claude.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Link para a conversa: <a href=\"https://claude.ai/share/f8f34cb3-97c1-44e8-9ba7-df3c4ee6fade\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://claude.ai/share/f8f34cb3-97c1-44e8-9ba7-df3c4ee6fade</a></span></span>"
